Protect CSV/XLSX exports against formula injection, escape imported content in HTML, and revoke temporary object URLs. Preserve useful workbook formatting and expected operational sheet layouts without fixed 2026 dates. App reset must remove only app-owned data; never call localStorage.clear() across the origin.

7. Global conversational assistant

Add a labelled Ask SD OS button that opens a docked side panel on desktop and a full-screen panel on mobile. It must not obscure essential controls or open automatically. Include conversation, input, current scope, provider state, Stop, Clear conversation, and expand controls. Show a few useful starter actions rather than a wall of examples.

The assistant can read all authorized application data across every module, including source metadata and available raw rows. Access does not mean sending the entire database to an LLM. Use bounded structured retrieval, exact application calculations, joins on stable IDs, pagination, and on-demand details. Default to current page/team/date filters and explicitly disclose scope; allow All data or another scope when requested.

Two honest modes:

1. No provider configured: deterministic Local commands mode supports a documented set of queries/actions, command suggestions, navigation, and structured forms. It must actually execute supported commands, disclose the limited grammar, and decline unsupported free-form requests. Never fake model responses.
2. Provider configured: natural-language tool calling through the provider adapter using validated tools. Handle streaming if supported, cancellation, timeouts, rate limits, malformed outputs, unsupported tool-calling, context limits, and provider errors. No fixed model required; make model/base URL configurable. A connection test must perform a real bounded request.

Never claim arbitrary tasks are possible. Every UI-exposed domain action must either have an equivalent registered assistant tool or a clear reason it requires manual input. Browser file selection and external account actions must accurately request the required user interaction.

